\begin{abstract}
The Sovereign Engine AAAHSC-9.4 is a distributed relativistic compute architecture
designed to synchronize micro-void vacuum extraction across MPI/CUDA clusters,
dynamically refine BSSN mesh resolution using real-time astrophysical telemetry,
and verify the Capsule 3090-A invariant through temporal CUDA sweeps.
